INSERT OR IGNORE INTO catalogue_pages (catalogue_id, page_num, text_content, char_count, has_extractable_text, search_text) VALUES ('24c796309c95d7fa', 13, ' Commercial Hinges
In the mid 1800s, Charles Hager had a successful business forging metal wheel rims and hinges for wagons headed west.
As a smart businessman who valued quality and innovation, Charles soon became a pioneer in product development, designing
a revolutionary hinge that became a prototype for more than 5,000 hinges to follow.

Today, the Hager name is synonymous with commercial hinges. In fact, we are the industry’s premiere designer and
manufacturer of commercial hinges, with a product line that offers one of the widest varieties of sizes, shapes, and finishes--
all of which meet or exceed ANSI standards. With legendary quality, time-tested durability, and consistent superior performance,
Hager is the one name, and one brand, you can count on to provide it all.


