intermittent duty (pulse).

modifications are made to full mortise hinges. swing clear modifications are only available on heavy weight hinges. for other
applications, consult hager engineering for availability.

it is recommended that the center hinge location be used with all electrically modified hinges.

hager companies recommends the use of a mortar box or jamb box in order to protect the wire terminations on the inside of the
frame. if this box is not used, the grout that may be poured into the frame will destroy the wiring and usually void the warranty
on the product.




 emn etw etm
 concealed electric hinge modification



quick connect harness cables - available on etw 4, 8, and 12 wire. not available with 18 gauge wire.
connectors installed on one end, pigtails on the other for easy installation in the field.
