 SINGLE ACTING
 The following single acting spring hinges are for automatic closing of doors, please note:
 • 1150 is not available in 3-1/2” x 3-1/2” (89 mm x 89 mm) and 4” x 4” (102 mm x 102 mm) sizes.
 • 1250 is available with raised barrel for square edge or beveled doors.
