 Hager’s 3300 Series Grade 3 tubular leverset is field reversible, with a thru-bolt design for ease of installation. This field
 reversible lock is designed with thru-bolts to make installation quick and simple. The 3300 Series is offered in three functions
 — Passage, Privacy, and Single Dummy — with four lever designs — Archer, August, Johnston and Withnell — to provide the
 perfect solution for suiting with other Grade 1 and Grade 2 products provided by Hager. Vertical markets that may benefit are
 assisted living facilities as well as multi-family.




