 • Floor mount (double door): 9-5/8” (244 mm)

 Fasteners: Hardware package, mounting bracket

 Notes: • Optional aluminum extension and misalignment rods available
 • Replacement armature disc and armature plate assemblies available
 • Adhesive template included

 FINISHES US3, LS, L2




