 APPLICATION • Control pedestrian traffic
 - Airport & Public Facility Security and Safety
 - Loss Prevention
 • Wandering Patient and Infant Protection (Compatible with Hugs® and other patient tracking systems)
 • Intended for single or double doors that require panic hardware
